{
	"Site": "Nexus",
	"Id": 45781,
	"Name": "A New traveller---Yue",
	"Author": "Disnamable",
	"AuthorLabel": "Hong",
	"Description": "[center][color=#00ff00][size=5]Yue[/size][/color][size=4] is a wandering traveler who arrived in Pelican Town not long ago. Will this be her final stop? [/size][/center]\n<br />[center][size=4]She lives a peculiar life. She resides in a basement by the sea, yet very few people know where she stays. [/size][/center]\n<br />[center][size=4]She loves collecting odd trinkets from her travels, such as trees that grow frozen crystal orbs.\n<br />She holds a secret. She might share it with you, but don’t tell anyone before a certain point in time. [/size][/center]\n<br />[center][size=4]She holds a hidden identity — can you uncover it? [/size][/center]\n<br />[center][size=4][img]https://staticdelivery.nexusmods.com/mods/1303/images/45781/45781-1785303494-63273365.png[/img][/size][/center]\n<br />[center][/center]\n<br />[center][quote][size=5]Marriageable NPC\n<br />Over 10 new heart events\n<br />Over 10 new crops\n<br />9 fruit trees [/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][img]https://staticdelivery.nexusmods.com/mods/1303/images/45781/45781-1779663443-1677210756.png[/img][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=5] Over 10 new fish\n<br />3 custom maps\n<br />7 custom community center bundles\n<br />Custom spouse room and patio\n<br />...\n<br />Magical items with unique special abilities included!!\n<br />May they bring you blessings and good fortune.[/size][/quote][/center]\n<br />[center][size=5]She loves sleeping in and usually gets up very late in the morning.\u00A0[/size][/center]\n<br />[center][size=5]She joins [color=#00ff00]Caroline[/color]’s fitness club every Tuesday.\u00A0[/size][/center]\n<br />[center][size=5]Her favorite gifts are starfruit, ancient fruit, and salad.\u00A0[/size][/center]\n<br />[center][size=5]She also adores prismatic shards and rabbit’s feet.\u00A0[/size][/center]\n<br />[center][size=5][color=#9900ff]Abigail[/color] and [color=#ff7700]Penny[/color] are her closest friends.[/size][/center]\n<br />[center]\n<br />[color=#cc0000][size=6] To truly understand who she is, the farmer will need to befriend her. [/size][/color][/center]\n<br />[center]\n<br />[img]https://staticdelivery.nexusmods.com/mods/1303/images/45781/45781-1779662363-570517819.png[/img][/center]\n<br />[center]\n<br />[quote][left][size=5]# 0.5 Heart Event: You can meet her at the Saloon between 8 PM and 9 PM on Friday nights. [/size]\n<br />[size=5]# 1 Heart Event: You can meet her at Pierre's General Store from 12 PM to 4 PM. [/size]\n<br />[size=5]# 2 Heart Event: You can meet her at Robin's house between 8 AM and 10 AM. [/size]\n<br />[size=5]# 4 Heart Event: You can meet her at the Library from 9 AM to 12 PM. [/size]\n<br />[size=5]# 6 Heart Event: You can meet her at Haley's house between 2 PM and 4 PM. [/size]\n<br />[size=5]# 8 Heart Event: Receive her mail, then meet her at the Mountain Lake after asking her out on a date. [/size]\n<br />[size=5]# 11 Heart Event: You can meet her on the beach between 10 PM and 12 AM during rainy nights.[/size][/left]\n<br />[left][size=5]......[/size]\n<br />\n<br />[center][color=#274e13][size=6] And there are plenty more heart events to discover!!! [/size][/color][/center]\n<br />[center][size=6][color=#9900ff][img width=48,height=96]https://staticdelivery.nexusmods.com/mods/1303/images/45781/45781-1779664214-807360050.png[/img]\u00A0 Maybe more story interactions with Abigail?[img width=48,height=96]https://staticdelivery.nexusmods.com/mods/1303/images/45781/45781-1779664145-613025975.png[/img][/color][/size][/center]\n<br />[/left]\n<br />[/quote][size=6]This is only Version 3.2.0! [/size]\n<br />[size=6] More updates are planned for the future.[/size][/center]\n<br />[center][size=6]3.3.0 is coming soon.[/size]\n<br />\n<br />[quote][left][size=6] Compatibility [/size]\n<br />[size=5] Compatible with major mods such as SVE, RSV, East Scarp, Sunberry and more. [/size][/left]\n<br />[left][size=5]There are no known compatibility issues at this time.\n<br />Please report to me if you encounter any compatibility conflicts or unknown bugs.[/size]\n<br />[/left]\n<br />[/quote][left][size=4]If you'd like to contribute portraits, sprites, textures and other assets for Yue, you are more than welcome to do so.\n<br />Also welcome anyone who wants to provide i18n translations for this mod. [/size][/left]\n<br />[left][size=4]Currently supports [/size][size=6]Chinese, English, Spanish, Vietnamese [/size][size=4]and[/size][size=6] Thai. [/size][/left]\n<br />[left][size=4]Vietnamese and Thai translations require downloading separate translation mods. [/size][/left]\n<br />[left][size=4]All translations except Chinese, Vietnamese and Thai are AI-generated. Native speakers and other volunteers are invited to submit human-corrected translations. [/size][/left]\n<br />[left][size=4]This mod is exclusively released on Nexus Mods, and I am the sole creator. Any other uploads claiming to be this mod are counterfeit. [/size][/left]\n<br />[left][center][/center]\n<br />[center][size=6][color=#38761d]Future Updates: [/color]\n<br />One or two additional story arcs\n<br />More portrait and sprite variants compatible\n<br />More magical unique items\n<br />Cross-mod heart events and dialogue with other mods\n<br />Extra custom NPCs tied to Yue[/size][/center]\n<br />[center][size=6]...\n<br />The next update won't take long. [/size][/center]\n<br />[center][/center]\n<br />[center][size=6][img]https://staticdelivery.nexusmods.com/mods/1303/images/45781/45781-1779662547-1438425409.png[/img][/size][/center]\n<br />[/left]\n<br />\n<br />[quote] Requirements:\n<br />[color=#00ff00][size=6]Content Patcher\n<br />Unlockable Bundles\n<br />SpaceCore\n<br />Misc Map Actions Properties\n<br />DaisyNiko's Tilesheets[/size][/color][/quote][/center]\n<br />[center][/center]\n<br />[center][size=5]Thank you to every player who downloaded and supported this mod. [/size][/center]\n<br />[center][size=5]Download counts, endorsements, and your comments fuel my motivation to create. [/size][/center]\n<br />[center][size=5]I’m deeply grateful to the Stardew Valley Wiki for providing immense assistance during mod development. [/size][/center]\n<br />[center][size=6]Thank you all! [/size][/center]\n<br />",
